{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J9SMLUGqYXhE1UPF5Hcggg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Researching: Animal Husbandry (9 turns)\\nCivic: Code of Laws (14 turns)\\n\\nAvailable techs:\\n  Animal Husbandry (TECH_ANIMAL_HUSBANDRY) [ANCIENT] — 10%, 9 turns -> Pasture, Camp, Kurgan, Reveals Horses\\n  Pottery (TECH_POTTERY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Granary, Great Bath, Mekewap\\n  Mining (TECH_MINING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 10 turns -> Mine, Quarry\\n  Sailing (TECH_SAILING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Found a city on the Coast.] -> Galley, Viking Longship, Bireme, Fishing Boats, Fishery\\n  Astrology (TECH_ASTROLOGY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 19 turns [Boost: Find a natural wonder.] -> Shrine, Stonehenge, Holy Site, Lavra\\n\\nAvailable civics:\\n  Code of Laws (CIVIC_CODE_OF_LAWS) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 15 turns\\n\\nLocked techs (prerequisites missing):\\n  -- ANCIENT --\\n  Irrigation (TECH_IRRIGATION) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Farm a resource.]\\n  Archery (TECH_ARCHERY) — needs: Animal Husbandry [Boost: Kill a unit with a Slinger.]\\n  Writing (TECH_WRITING) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Meet another civilization.]\\n  Masonry (TECH_MASONRY) — needs: Mining [Boost: Build a Quarry.]\\n  Bronze Working (TECH_BRONZE_WORKING) — needs: Mining [Boost: Kill 3 Barbarians.]\\n  Wheel (TECH_THE_WHEEL) — needs: Mining [Boost: Mine a resource.]\\n  -- CLASSICAL --\\n  Celestial Navigation (TECH_CELESTIAL_NAVIGATION) — needs: Sailing, Astrology [Boost: Improve 2 sea resources.]\\n  Currency (TECH_CURRENCY) — needs: Writing [Boost: Make a [ICON_TradeRoute] Trade Route.]\\n  Horseback Riding (TECH_HORSEBACK_RIDING) — needs: Archery [Boost: Build a Pasture.]\\n  Iron Working (TECH_IRON_WORKING) — needs: Bronze Working [Boost: Build an Iron Mine.]\\n  Shipbuilding (TECH_SHIPBUILDING) — needs: Sailing [Boost: Own 2 Galleys.]\\n  Mathematics (TECH_MATHEMATICS) — needs: Currency [Boost: Build 3 different specialty districts.]\\n  Construction (TECH_CONSTRUCTION) — needs: Masonry, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build a Water Mill.]\\n  Engineering (TECH_ENGINEERING) — needs: Wheel [Boost: Build Ancient Walls.]\\n  -- MEDIEVAL --\\n  Military Tactics (TECH_MILITARY_TACTICS) — needs: Mathematics [Boost: Kill a unit with a Spearman.]\\n  Apprenticeship (TECH_APPRENTICESHIP) — needs: Currency, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build 3 Mines.]\\n  Machinery (TECH_MACHINERY) — needs: Iron Working, Engineering [Boost: Own 3 Archers.]\\n  Education (TECH_EDUCATION) — needs: Mathematics, Apprenticeship [Boost: Earn a Great Scientist.]\\n  Stirrups (TECH_STIRRUPS) — needs: Horseback Riding, Apprenticeship [Boost: Have the Feudalism civic.]\\n  Military Engineering (TECH_MILITARY_ENGINEERING) — needs: Construction [Boost: Build an Aqueduct.]\\n  Castles (TECH_CASTLES) — needs: Construction [Boost: Adopt a government with 6 inherent policy slots.]\\n  Buttress (TECH_BUTTRESS) — needs: Shipbuilding, Mathematics [Boost: Build a Classical era or later wonder]\\n\\nLocked civics (prerequisites missing):\\n  -- ANCIENT --\\n  Craftsmanship (CIVIC_CRAFTSMANSHIP) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Improve 3 tiles.]\\n  Foreign Trade (CIVIC_FOREIGN_TRADE) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Discover a second continent.]\\n  Military Tradition (CIVIC_MILITARY_TRADITION) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Clear a Barbarian Outpost.]\\n  State Workforce (CIVIC_STATE_WORKFORCE) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Build any specialty district.]\\n  Early Empire (CIVIC_EARLY_EMPIRE) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Grow your civilization to at least 6 population.]\\n  Mysticism (CIVIC_MYSTICISM) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Found a pantheon.]\\n  -- CLASSICAL --\\n  Games and Recreation (CIVIC_GAMES_RECREATION) — needs: State Workforce [Boost: Research the Construction technology.]\\n  Political Philosophy (CIVIC_POLITICAL_PHILOSOPHY) — needs: State Workforce, Early Empire [Boost: Meet 3 city-states.]\\n  Drama and Poetry (CIVIC_DRAMA_POETRY) — needs: Early Empire [Boost: